OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786643327
OL,3,CFrom Tullycarnet to Broadway, dance
OL,4,Cgroup perform in the Big Apple
OL,6,FWhat do Tullycarnet and Broadway have
OL,7,Fin common?
OL,9,FTurns out, they have both been graced
OL,10,Fby the same talented feet of 13
OL,11,Fteenagers as they swapped the local
OL,12,Fcommunity centre for the bright lights
OL,13,Fof the Big Apple.
OL,15,FEarlier in August the dance group
OL,16,F'2crew4u' visited New York City and
OL,17,Fperformed on Broadway after winning a
OL,18,Fcompetition last year to do so.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
