FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786643327
OL,3,CFrom Tullycarnet to Broadway, dance
OL,4,Cgroup perform in the Big Apple
OL,6,FIt is something that coach Chloe
OL,7,FLatimer says was a 'dream come true'.
OL,8,FShe was also keen to point out how it
OL,9,Fshows that anyone can do whatever they
OL,10,Fwant if they put their mind to it.
OL,12,FChloe says: "I'm the proudest, like,
OL,13,Fdance teacher in the world.
OL,15,F"Like, proudest in Northern Ireland.
OL,16,FLike it's been a dream. It's honestly,
OL,17,Fmade me and my whole dance career
OL,18,Fcompletely worth it".
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786643327
OL,3,CFrom Tullycarnet to Broadway, dance
OL,4,Cgroup perform in the Big Apple
OL,6,FChloe continued: "So anybody can do
OL,7,Fit. Literally they just need to dream
OL,8,Fbig because that's what we done. And
OL,9,Fit just shows you that it can happen
OL,10,Fno matter where you're from.
OL,12,F"So whether you're from Belfast or New
OL,13,FYork, it just shows you like if you
OL,14,Fwork hard enough, and you're
OL,15,Fdetermined enough, it will get you
OL,16,Fwhere you want to be."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
