PN,41304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786643327
OL,3,CFrom Tullycarnet to Broadway, dance
OL,4,Cgroup perform in the Big Apple
OL,6,FWhile many might have been nervous to
OL,7,Ftake to the stage for Brooke Sloane,
OL,8,Fit was all pretty straightforward: "So
OL,9,FI thought it was going to be, like,
OL,10,Freally scary. But, like, whenever I
OL,11,Fwent on stage, it wasn't even scary at
OL,12,Fall.
OL,14,F"And it's like the same at
OL,15,Fcompetitions. It's really scary going
OL,16,Fonstage, but, when you're actually on
OL,17,Fit dancing it's not at all.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
