OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786643327
OL,3,CFrom Tullycarnet to Broadway, dance
OL,4,Cgroup perform in the Big Apple
OL,6,FWinning the competition was one thing.
OL,7,FHowever, with the cost of the trip
OL,8,Fstretching into the tens of thousands,
OL,9,Fpaying for it was difficult.
OL,11,FHowever, Chloe says the community
OL,12,Fstepped up to help pay the way: "We
OL,13,Fput it on Facebook, we did a Go Fund
OL,14,Fme. We done ballot collections. Like
OL,15,Fballot bucket collections, quiz night,
OL,16,Feverything. We done a lot in here. We
OL,17,Fdone a lot, elsewhere. But everyone
OL,18,Fhelped.
OL,20,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,21,FITVX
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/6
